# Photo triage/review artifacts — local review tools, not part of the product.
# They inline every image as a data URI, so each runs to megabytes and GitHub's
# language stats read the repo as ~90% HTML instead of TypeScript.
#
# Anchored with a leading slash so these only match this directory. Product data
# that lives deeper is unaffected and stays tracked:
#   gen/photos.json              imported by lib/data.ts
#   public/players/CREDITS.json  attribution written by fetch-photos.ts
#   public/players/*.jpg         the actual card portraits
/photo-*.html
/photo-*.md
/photo-*.json
